        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Francine McDougall, Adam Rothenberg\n- Films: Sugar & Spice, Someone's Knocking at the Door\n- Songs: \"She's So Huge\"\n- Bands: The Moon Men\n\nFacts:\n- Francine McDougall directed the 2001 American teen crime comedy film Sugar & Spice.\n- The song \"She's So Huge\" was performed by the band The Moon Men and was featured in Sugar & Spice.\n- Adam Rothenberg played instruments in The Moon Men.\n- Adam Rothenberg also starred in the film Someone's Knocking at the Door.",
