        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Francine McDougall, Marley Shelton, Marla Sokoloff, Mena Suvari, James Marsden, Melissa George, Jordan Lawson, Noah Segan, Andrea Rueda, Ezra Buzzington, Elina Madison, Jon Budinoff, Ricardo Gray, Lew Temple, Vernon Wells\n- Organizations: The Flys, The Nymphs, The Jade Amenity, Sonic Shot, The Seattles, The Tantrum Junkies, Rocket\n- Works: Sugar & Spice, Someone's Knocking at the Door, \"She's So Huge\"\n- Roles: bassist, mandolin player, harmonica player\n\nFacts:\n- In 2001, the song \"She's So Huge\" by The Flys was featured in the film Sugar & Spice.\n- In 2001, Sugar & Spice was released as an American teen crime comedy film directed by Francine McDougall.\n- Sugar & Spice stars Marley Shelton, Marla Sokoloff, Mena Suvari, James Marsden, and Melissa George.\n- Jordan Lawson is known for playing mandolin and harmonica and for being a bassist.\n- Jordan Lawson has been the bassist in The Flys, The Nymphs, The Jade Amenity, Sonic Shot, The Seattles, The Tantrum Junkies, and Rocket.\n- Someone's Knocking at the Door stars Noah Segan, Andrea Rueda, Ezra Buzzington, Elina Madison, Jon Budinoff, Ricardo Gray, Jordan Lawson, Lew Temple, and Vernon Wells.",
